# Backend

- Use async methods for I/O and accept a `CancellationToken`. Pass it through.
- Register services with dependency injection. Do not new up infrastructure from business code.
- Controllers and minimal-API handlers stay thin. Business decisions live in the application layer.
- Domain and Application projects must not reference Infrastructure, the API, or the worker.
- Prefer enum or state types over magic strings for job status and attempt outcome.
- Validate input at the boundary. Return Problem Details for API errors once the job API exists.
- Do not log secrets or full job payloads.
